    <value># About: Local Help

Local help for the CDPI UI application. Allows local access to information hosted at [storik4pro.github.io/cdpiui/wiki](https://storik4pro.github.io/cdpiui/wiki). It is not updated automatically.

#### Help authors:
- Storik4

#### Contribute!
Create a help article! For more information, visit [storik4pro.github.io/cdpiui/wiki/community](https://storik4pro.github.io/cdpiui/wiki/community)

Help is displayed using `CommunityToolkit.WinUI.Controls.MarkdownTextBlock`</value>
